The Role…

As the Lead Digital Analyst, you will be the go-to expert for how our audiences behave across our websites, apps and platforms, and you will make sure the data behind those insights is accurate, well structured and actionable. Reporting to the Head of Digital Analytics, you will manage one analyst. You will work closely with colleagues across audience growth, customer data, membership, ecommerce, editorial, brand and analysts and engineers around the world. This is a senior, hands-on role where your tracking and tagging expertise will shape the quality of data across the whole team.

Main Duties…

• Own tracking across our sites and apps, from defining what needs to be measured to implementing it in Google Tag Manager and GA4, either independently or alongside engineers and third-party partners

