• Analyse data from a wide range of sources, including web and app behaviour, search, social, advertising, video and ecommerce, to turn it into clear insights and recommendations for non-technical audiences

• Line manage and develop one digital analyst, and support the wider team through coaching, review of work and sharing of best practice

• Build strong working relationships with teams across the business and with global colleagues, and champion responsible, efficient use of AI to automate tasks and upskill the team

