• Extensive hands-on experience with Google Tag Manager and analytics tag implementation, with the ability to define tracking requirements and troubleshoot data issues independently

• Strong experience with GA4 and a solid understanding of web and app analytics, ideally across multiple data types such as behavioural, search, social, advertising and ecommerce data

• Very good SQL skills, with experience of BigQuery and Google Cloud Platform, including creating tables and scheduling queries

• Proven experience building dashboards in Looker or Looker Studio, alongside confident use of Excel and Google Sheets

• Experience managing or mentoring analysts, with the ability to support colleagues at different levels of experience

• Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills, with the ability to explain complex data simply and influence decisions across teams

• A genuine interest in AI and how to use it well: prompting effectively, applying it with appropriate caution and using it to improve efficiency, automate work and develop skills.

