• A methodical approach, good attention to detail and the judgement to prioritise issues by their impact on users.

• Familiarity with test management or bug tracking tools, such as Jira.

• Some experience with test automation tools or basic scripting; this is desirable.

• A collaborative mindset and interest in improving the quality and accessibility of digital products.

